  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASSOPRO Buramata Rice Production Improvement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to augment its revenue through increased rice production by learning and applying modern rice production and processing techniques; obtaining better warehousing facilities as well as sensitizing members about effective marketing and negotiation techniques. Funds willbe used for a storage facility; farming tools; a vehicle; hiring staff; and trainings on agricultural production and leadership and management.</narrative>
  </description>
